Overline “‾” (U+203E)  macron/长音符号 “¯” (U+00AF)

Spacing Overline (‾): U+203E
— A standalone overline character.
Spacing Macron (¯): U+00AF
— A traditional modifier letter macron (high flat line).
Combining Overline (̅): U+0305
— Places a line directly above the character that precedes it.
Combining Macron (̄): U+0304
— Places a smaller macron mark above the preceding letter.

